{
  "name": "01 - Support Ticket Classifier",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup checklist after import\n1. Create credential **OpenAI API** (or swap the Chat Model node for Azure OpenAI) — used by 'OpenAI Chat Model' and 'OpenAI - Draft Auto Reply'.\n2. Create credential **Postgres** — host `postgres`, db/user/password from your `.env` — used by 'Postgres - Insert Ticket'.\n3. Make sure `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` is set in `.env` (restart the n8n container after editing), or swap the HTTP Request nodes for the native Slack node.\n4. Run `sql/init.sql` once against Postgres to create the `tickets` table.\n5. Activate the workflow, then test:\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/support-ticket \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"customerId\":\"CUST-1001\",\"message\":\"Our main office has had zero internet connectivity since 9am, this is urgent.\"}'\n```\n6. Second intake channel (simulated inbound email, e.g. SendGrid/Mailgun-style webhook):\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/support-ticket-email \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"from\":\"jane.doe@acme.com\",\"subject\":\"Cannot access my account\",\"text\":\"I have been locked out since yesterday and need urgent help.\"}'\n```",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sticky-instructions",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "support-ticket",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook - New Ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-60, 380],
      "webhookId": "support-ticket-demo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "support-ticket-email",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger-email",
      "name": "Webhook - Email Ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-60, 560],
      "webhookId": "support-ticket-email-demo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "norm-customer-id",
              "name": "customerId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.customerId || $json.body?.from }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-message",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.message || ($json.body?.subject + ': ' + $json.body?.text) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-source",
              "name": "source",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.customerId ? 'webhook' : 'email' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "normalize-input",
      "name": "Normalize Ticket Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [140, 470]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ 'Classify this customer support message. Message: ' + $json.message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a customer support ticket classification assistant.\n\nClassify the customer's message into exactly one category: network_outage, database_issue, billing_invoice, or other.\nDetermine a priority: low, medium, high, or critical.\nWrite a one-sentence summary of the issue.\nProvide a confidence score from 0 to 1 for your classification.\n\nThe confidence score reflects how clearly the message maps to a real, actionable support issue, not just how sure you are of the category label. If the message is ambiguous, unclear which department it belongs to, off-topic, or does not clearly describe a concrete network_outage, database_issue, or billing_invoice problem, classify it as category \"other\" and give it a confidence score below 0.5, since these cases need a human reviewer.\n\nRegardless of the message's content or tone, never reply conversationally or answer the customer directly. Always respond only with the structured classification fields defined by the output schema."
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent-classify",
      "name": "AI Agent - Classify & Extract",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [220, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "lm-openai",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 620],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "OpenAi account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"network_outage\", \"database_issue\", \"billing_invoice\", \"other\"] },\n    \"priority\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\", \"critical\"] },\n    \"summary\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"confidence\": { \"type\": \"number\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"category\", \"priority\", \"summary\", \"confidence\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "output-parser",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [360, 620]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "schema": { "__rl": true, "value": "public", "mode": "list" },
        "table": { "__rl": true, "value": "tickets", "mode": "list" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "customer_id": "={{ $('Normalize Ticket Input').first().json.customerId }}",
            "category": "={{ $json.output.category }}",
            "priority": "={{ $json.output.priority }}",
            "summary": "={{ $json.output.summary }}",
            "confidence": "={{ $json.output.confidence }}",
            "raw_message": "={{ $('Normalize Ticket Input').first().json.message }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.output.confidence >= 0.6 ? 'classified' : 'needs_review' }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "postgres-insert",
      "name": "Postgres - Insert Ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [560, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "confidence-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.confidence }}",
              "rightValue": 0.6,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-confidence",
      "name": "IF - Confidence >= 0.6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [800, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"text\": \":rotating_light: New ticket [\" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.priority.toUpperCase() + \"] \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.category + \" — Customer \" + $('Normalize Ticket Input').first().json.customerId + \" (via \" + $('Normalize Ticket Input').first().json.source + \"): \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.summary } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "slack-notify",
      "name": "Notify Slack - Standard",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1040, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "text",
        "operation": "message",
        "modelId": { "__rl": true, "value": "gpt-4o-mini", "mode": "list" },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You write short, professional, empathetic customer support acknowledgment messages."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ \"Write a brief professional acknowledgment reply to a customer about their support ticket. Category: \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.category + \". Priority: \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.priority + \". Summary: \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.summary }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "openai-auto-reply",
      "name": "OpenAI - Draft Auto Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1260, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "OpenAi account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"classified\", \"category\": $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.category, \"priority\": $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.priority, \"reply\": $json.output[0].content[0].text } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-success",
      "name": "Respond - Classified",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1480, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"text\": \":warning: Low-confidence ticket needs human review — Customer \" + $('Normalize Ticket Input').first().json.customerId + \" (via \" + $('Normalize Ticket Input').first().json.source + \"): \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.summary + \" (confidence \" + $('AI Agent - Classify & Extract').item.json.output.confidence + \")\" } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "slack-escalate",
      "name": "Notify Slack - Escalation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1040, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"pending_review\", \"message\": \"Thanks for reaching out — your request needs a closer look from our team and we'll follow up shortly.\" } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-review",
      "name": "Respond - Needs Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1260, 520]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - New Ticket": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Normalize Ticket Input", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Webhook - Email Ticket": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Normalize Ticket Input", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Normalize Ticket Input": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "AI Agent - Classify & Extract", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "OpenAI Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [[{ "node": "AI Agent - Classify & Extract", "type": "ai_languageModel", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Structured Output Parser": {
      "ai_outputParser": [[{ "node": "AI Agent - Classify & Extract", "type": "ai_outputParser", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "AI Agent - Classify & Extract": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Postgres - Insert Ticket", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Postgres - Insert Ticket": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "IF - Confidence >= 0.6", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "IF - Confidence >= 0.6": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Notify Slack - Standard", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Notify Slack - Escalation", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Notify Slack - Standard": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "OpenAI - Draft Auto Reply", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "OpenAI - Draft Auto Reply": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond - Classified", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Notify Slack - Escalation": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond - Needs Review", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
